1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
Who controls the scene?

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
And who answers?

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,250
VOICE: What do you
want to do?

4
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,750
VOICE: Does anyone want
to come up and hit Gerry?

5
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,750
VOICE: Raise your hand.

6
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:09,750
AUDIENCE: Can I hit him?

7
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:10,750
VOICE: You can hit him.

8
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:12,250
AUDIENCE: As much as
we want?

9
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:12,750
VOICE: Yes.

10
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,750
JIARUI: But I will
fight back.

11
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,750
We have four directors
in the scene now.

12
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,500
Let the three of them
move on.

13
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,750
Why? I just won't
get down.
